              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 10.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka laco mo onoŋo dako ce onyomo, ka dakone pe yomo cwinye pien onoŋo roc mo i kome, laco twero coyo waraga me keto nyom, miyo i ciŋe, ryeme kwede woko ki i ode, ci dako-ni a woko ki i ode. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ka laco mukene onyome, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ce cware ma lacen-ni bene pe mite ci coyo waraga me keto nyom, miyo i ciŋe ci ryeme kwede woko ki i ode, nyo ka cware me aryone oto woko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci cware mukwoŋo ma yam oryeme woko pe dok owar en me bedo dakone ma onoŋo en doŋ oballe pi doko dako pa ŋat mukene, pien kit tim macalo meno bedo me kwer i nyim Rwot, wun pe wubikelo bal i kom lobo ma Rwot Lubaŋawu bimiyo botwu me aleyawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
